body:
Someone has strapped explosives to nearly every entity!
Don't get too close, as any of them can explode at any moment.
They will also explode as soon as they take any damage whatsoever.

There are only a handful of exceptions to make the game beatable, so entities such as armor stands, paintings, boats, and falling blocks will explode,
the latter creating explosion rays going straight up, and coming back down like a meteor.


The following entities do not explode:
- items;
- experience orbs;
- blazes;
- piglins;
- eyes of ender;
- the Ender Dragon;
- end crystals; and
- players.
